====== ASUS WL-320gE / WL-320gP ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

The ASUS WL-320g is a simple wireless access point featuring one fast ethernet port and 54Mbps Broadcom wireless.
The WL-320gP variant is PoE capable.

