===== Specific Configuration =====

The WL-320gE and WL-320gP have one LAN port only, however it seems to be connected internally as switch port 3.
So your switch configuration should look something like this:

| ''config 'switch' 'eth0'
        option 'reset' '1'

config 'switch_vlan' 'eth0_3'
        option 'device' 'eth0'
        option 'vlan' '0'
        option 'ports' '3 5*' '' |

See [[::doc:uci:network]] configuration for details.

